      "metaTitle": "Asset-Based Financing: Unleashing the Power of Your Assets | EPOCH Financial",
      "metaDescription": "Learn how asset-based financing can unlock working capital using your business assets. Discover flexible funding solutions to boost growth and improve cash flow.",
      "metaKeywords": "asset based financing",
      "image": "/assets/images/blog/wp/asset-based-financing-unleashing-the-power-of-your-assets.webp",
