              "text": "Apparel is a highly seasonal industry. Collections are often planned months in advance and launched in sync with consumer trends, holidays, or fashion cycles. When a brand experiences a surge in demand, there is immense pressure to deliver on time. Delays in production or shipping can result in lost sales, strained buyer relationships, and damage to brand reputation."
