      "slug": "lower-middle-market-private-equity",
      "title": "How Private Equity Creates Value in Lower Middle Market Businesses?",
      "description": "Private equity plays a significant role in driving growth and long-term value for lower middle market businesses. These companies, typically generating between $5 million and $100 million in annual re",
      "metaTitle": "How Private Equity Creates Value in Lower Middle Market Businesses? | EPOCH Financial",
