              "text": "EPOCH Financial specializes in accounts receivable financing, AR-anchored asset-based lending, and selective bridge solutions for middle market companies with complex operating and working capital requirements. We work closely with CFOs and executive teams to structure facilities that improve liquidity without constraining growth."
