              "text": "Traditionally, banks and institutional lenders have been the primary sources of oil and gas business loans and structured oil and gas lending solutions. While these remain important, the industry’s evolving landscape has opened the door for new funding approaches. Private capital has emerged as a powerful alternative, offering flexibility and strategic support beyond what conventional lenders typically provide."
