              "text": "In today’s energy-driven economy, where market volatility, regulatory changes, and global demand shape investment decisions, access to diverse funding sources is vital. Oil and gas funding backed by private investors not only strengthens project viability but also ensures companies have the financial capacity to adapt to shifting market conditions. Understanding this role of private capital highlights its growing influence in the broader finance in oil and gas industry."
