              "text": "While private capital provides much-needed flexibility and funding, it also comes with challenges that companies must carefully consider. The costs, investor requirements, and long-term implications of relying on this type of oil and gas funding can affect both profitability and operational control. Understanding these challenges is essential before committing to private investment as part of a broader oil and gas financing strategy."
