              "text": "The energy transition is reshaping how capital flows into the sector. Environmental, social, and governance priorities are influencing investor decisions and changing the profile of acceptable projects. Private capital is responding by seeking opportunities that combine sustainability with solid returns, and this shift will affect how companies secure oil and gas funding and structure financing oil and gas projects going forward."
