                  "When liquidity pressure threatens day to day operations The company struggles to cover payroll, vendor payments, inventory needs, or project costs without additional capital.",
                  "When time sensitive issues require fast action Situations like supply chain shortages, customer delays, production gaps, or urgent restructuring demand quick funding decisions."
