      "description": "Capital structure is no longer a static financing decision. For middle market companies, it has become a dynamic tool that directly shapes how growth is funded, how risk is absorbed, and how value is",
      "metaTitle": "Middle Market Companies Optimize Capital Structure | EPOCH Financial",
